ta\">Team 40+, passive income mulai</span></div></article></div><div class=\"text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto p-6 bg-white/50 rounded-2xl border border-warm-border\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-circle w-10 h-10 mx-auto text-terracotta/50 mb-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z\"></path></svg><p class=\"body-base text-soft-black/80 italic text-center max-w-xl mx-auto\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\">&quot;Yang beda: Ika nggak cuma kasih materi, tapi nemenin sampe bisa.&quot;</p><p class=\"text-xs text-text-muted mt-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\">— Member Level 2, Surabaya</p></div></div><div class=\"text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><p class=\"body-base text-soft-black/70 mb-6 max-w-lg mx-auto\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\">Jadilah Pioneer Member. Cerita Bunda mungkin akan menjadi inspirasi ribuan ibu Indonesia lainnya.</p><a href=\"#challenge-form\" class=\"btn-secondary inline-block\" aria-label=\"Gabung Komunitas Pioneer (Early Bird)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users w-5 h-5 mr-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg>Gabung Komunitas Pioneer (Early Bird)</a></div></div></section><section id=\"faq\" class=\"section-padding bg-warm-sand\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-heading\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><span class=\"section-label\">TRANSPARANSI</span><h2 id=\"faq-heading\" class=\"heading-2 mb-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\">Pertanyaan yang Sering Diajukan — Jujur &amp; Transparan</h2><p class=\"body-lg text-soft-black/70\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\">Kami percaya keputusan terbaik lahir dari informasi lengkap. Tidak ada rahasia, tidak ada tekanan. Hanya fakta.</p></div><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-warm-border overflow-hidden\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><button class=\"w-full px-6 py-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-terracotta/50 focus:ring-offset-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-answer-0\"><p class=\"body-base font-medium text-soft-black text-left pr-8\" style=\"opacity:1\">Apakah ini MLM / Network Marketing?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 text-terracotta\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"transform:none\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></button><div id=\"faq-answer-0\" class=\"overflow-hidden\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-question-0\" style=\"height:0px;opacity:0\"><div class=\"px-6 pb-6 border-t border-warm-border/50\"><p class=\"mb-4 font-medium\">Ya, transparan: Level 3 menggunakan model Atomy (Consumer Direct Marketing).</p><p class=\"mb-4\">Tapi <strong class=\"text-terracotta\">Level 1 &amp; 2 fokus 100% Growth &amp; Leadership</strong> — zero selling, zero downline pressure. Anda bebas berhenti di Level 2 kalau cocok.</p><p>Atomy di Level 3 hanyalah <strong>vehicle income opsional</strong> untuk yang sudah punya fondasi kuat &amp; mau sharing produk konsumsi harian.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-warm-border overflow-hidden\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><button class=\"w-full px-6 py-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-terracotta/50 focus:ring-offset-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-answer-1\"><p class=\"body-base font-medium text-soft-black text-left pr-8\" style=\"opacity:1\">Berapa investasinya?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 text-terracotta\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"transform:none\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></button><div id=\"faq-answer-1\" class=\"overflow-hidden\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-question-1\" style=\"height:0px;opacity:0\"><div class=\"px-6 pb-6 border-t border-warm-border/50\"><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-white/50 rounded-xl\"><span class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-terracotta/10 flex items-center justify-center text-terracotta font-bold\">1</span><div><p class=\"font-medium\">Level 1 (Foundation): <span class=\"text-terracotta font-bold\">GRATIS</span></p><p class=\"text-sm text-soft-black/70\">7 hari challenge via WA + PDF Toolkit</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-white/50 rounded-xl\"><span class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-sage-green/10 flex items-center justify-center text-sage-green font-bold\">2</span><div><p class=\"font-medium\">Level 2 (Mastery): <span class=\"text-sage-green font-bold\">Rp 499rb/bln</span></p><p class=\"text-sm text-soft-black/70\">Coaching Maxwell, akses komunitas, template konten</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-white/50 rounded-xl\"><span class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-muted-clay/10 flex items-center justify-center text-muted-clay font-bold\">3</span><div><p class=\"font-medium\">Level 3 (Business): <span class=\"text-muted-clay font-bold\">Sesuai paket Atomy</span></p><p class=\"text-sm text-soft-black/70\">Mulai konsumsi sendiri ~Rp 300rb/bln. Tidak ada paket wajib beli grosir.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-warm-border overflow-hidden\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><button class=\"w-full px-6 py-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-terracotta/50 focus:ring-offset-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-answer-2\"><p class=\"body-base font-medium text-soft-black text-left pr-8\" style=\"opacity:1\">Apakah harus rekrut orang / jadi downline?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 text-terracotta\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"transform:none\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></button><div id=\"faq-answer-2\" class=\"overflow-hidden\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-question-2\" style=\"height:0px;opacity:0\"><div class=\"px-6 pb-6 border-t border-warm-border/50\"><p class=\"mb-4\"><strong class=\"text-terracotta\">Tidak wajib.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-4\">Level 1-2: <strong>Self-growth only.</strong> Fokus ke mindset, habit, leadership, komunikasi.</p><p class=\"mb-4\">Level 3 (Atomy): <strong>Sharing produk konsumsi harian</strong> — bukan &quot;rekrut downline&quot;. Banyak member hanya konsumen loyal + tambah penghasilan sampingan.</p><p>Modelnya: <strong>Konsumsi sendiri dulu, sharing organik kalau cocok.</strong> Bukan model &quot;rekrut rekrut rekrut&quot;.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-warm-border overflow-hidden\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><button class=\"w-full px-6 py-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-terracotta/50 focus:ring-offset-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-answer-3\"><p class=\"body-base font-medium text-soft-black text-left pr-8\" style=\"opacity:1\">Berapa komitmen waktu per hari?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 text-terracotta\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"transform:none\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></button><div id=\"faq-answer-3\" class=\"overflow-hidden\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-question-3\" style=\"height:0px;opacity:0\"><div class=\"px-6 pb-6 border-t border-warm-border/50\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-white/50 rounded-xl\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock w-5 h-5 text-terracotta\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg><div><p class=\"font-medium\">15–30 menit/hari</p><p class=\"text-sm text-soft-black/70\">Konten dikirim via WA — baca kapan nyaman</p></div></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm text-soft-black/70\">Coaching mingguan opsional (Zoom 60 menit). Desain untuk ibu sibuk.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-warm-border overflow-hidden\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><button class=\"w-full px-6 py-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-terracotta/50 focus:ring-offset-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-answer-4\"><p class=\"body-base font-medium text-soft-black text-left pr-8\" style=\"opacity:1\">Saya gaptek teknologi, bisa ikut?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 text-terracotta\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"transform:none\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></button><div id=\"faq-answer-4\" class=\"overflow-hidden\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-question-4\" style=\"height:0px;opacity:0\"><div class=\"px-6 pb-6 border-t border-warm-border/50\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-white/50 rounded-xl\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-smartphone w-5 h-5 text-terracotta\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"20\" x=\"5\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path></svg><div><p class=\"font-medium\">Bisa. Semua via WhatsApp.</p><p class=\"text-sm text-soft-black/70\">Tidak perlu app tambahan. Tim support bantu setup awal.</p></div></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm text-soft-black/70\">Banyak member 40+ th sukses. Teknologi cuma alat, bukan halangan.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-warm-border overflow-hidden\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><button class=\"w-full px-6 py-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-terracotta/50 focus:ring-offset-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-answer-5\"><p class=\"body-base font-medium text-soft-black text-left pr-8\" style=\"opacity:1\">Apa bedanya dengan kursus leadership lain?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 text-terracotta\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"transform:none\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></button><div id=\"faq-answer-5\" class=\"overflow-hidden\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-question-5\" style=\"height:0px;opacity:0\"><div class=\"px-6 pb-6 border-t border-warm-border/50\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-xl border border-warm-border text-center\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-terracotta/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open w-6 h-6 text-terracotta\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z\"></path><path d=\"M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z\"></path></svg></div><h4 class=\"font-medium mb-1\">Maxwell Certified</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-soft-black/70\">Metodologi terstruktur, bukan motivational talk biasa</p></div><div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-xl border border-warm-border text-center\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-sage-green/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target w-6 h-6 text-sage-green\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12